    <tei:body>
      <tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:barekhu/yitbarakh">
        <tei:pb ed="1965" n="2" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-sheni-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-two-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n6_medium.jpg"/>
        <tei:p>Blessed and praised, glorified, exalted and extolled be the Name of the Supreme King of Kings, the Holy One blessed be He. He is the first and He is the last and beside Him there is no God. Make way before Him, who is enthroned above the clouds, Yah is his Name and rejoice before Him. His Name is exalted above all blessing and fame. Blessed be His glorious royal Name for ever and ever.</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
